# 🛡 Minor Project 1 – Log Sentinel
## Mission: Detect Brute Force, SQL Injection & XSS in Apache Logs

---

# 🎯 Objective

Build a Python-based detection engine that:

- Parses Apache access logs
- Detects:
  - Brute force login attempts
  - SQL Injection payloads
  - XSS attacks
- Generates a structured JSON security report
- Supports threshold-based alerting

This project simulates a real SOC analyst task.

